etric","short":"Two kinds of crypto","main":"Asymmetric is for the handshake, symmetric is for data; the shared secret never crosses the network.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Asymmetric","Symmetric","Key exchange","Result"],"captions":["A key pair: the public key verifies what the private key signed","One shared key encrypts and decrypts, and it is fast","The handshake turns the first into the second: both sides derive a shared secret","The secret itself was never sent"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":40.0,"text":"asymmetric\npublic + private key","tone":"yellow","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":40.0,"text":"symmetric\none shared key","tone":"green","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5,"o":0.3},{"t":"text","id":"t1","x":90.0,"y":82.0,"text":"slow: for the handshake","tone":"yellow","size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":40.0,"text":"asymmetric\npublic + private key","tone":"yellow","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":40.0,"text":"symmetric\none shared key","tone":"green","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"t1","x":90.0,"y":82.0,"text":"slow: for the handshake","tone":"yellow","size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"t2","x":270.0,"y":82.0,"text":"fast: for all the data","tone":"green","size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":40.0,"text":"asymmetric\npublic + private key","tone":"yellow","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":50.0,"w":130.0,"h":40.0,"text":"symmetric\none shared key","tone":"green","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"t1","x":90.0,"y":82.0,"text":"slow: for the handshake","tone":"yellow","size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"t2","x":270.0,"y":82.0,"text":"fast: for all the data","tone":"green","size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"ar","x1":150.0,"y1":125.0,"x2":220.0,"y2":125.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"t3","x":180.0,"y":108.0,"text":"